<p>
  Your rent expired on <strong><%= @tenancy_end_date %></strong>, <%= pluralize(@elapsed_days, "day") %> ago.
  Please arrange payment as soon as possible so that we don't have to lock your room.
</p>
<%= render "payment_details" %>
